<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Tabuk Agricultural Q1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Saudi Tabuk Agricultural Q1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		 0.42    vs    0.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	   0.96    vs    1.23</p>
<p> Sales income	    16.84    vs   25.55</p>
<p> Net operating income   0.17    vs    1.84</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  399.64    vs  398.25</p>
<p>Full Name: Tabuk Agricultural Development Company.</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
